---
title: Review
navSection: review
permalink: "review/index.html"
layout: base.njk
---
{% from "macros.njk" import statusChip, driftChip, dimLabel with context %}

<h1>Lexia review</h1>

<p class="lede">
  Each of the {{ review.meta.lexiaCount }} policy paragraphs is one file under
  <code>content/lexias/</code>. This is the editorial view of them: review status, how far
  each has moved from the workshop text, and where paragraphs that ought to agree do not.
</p>

<h2>Status</h2>

<ul class="facets">
  {% for status in ["unreviewed", "in-review", "approved", "flagged"] %}
  {% set count = review.statusCounts[status] or 0 %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ ('/review/status/' + status + '/index.html') | rel }}">
      {{ statusChip(status) }}
      <span class="facets__count">{{ count }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Agreement between paragraphs</h2>

<p>
  The {{ review.meta.lexiaCount }} paragraphs fall into {{ review.meta.groupCount }} groups
  of the same employee, dimension and Hi/Lo setting. Within a group you would expect the
  same sentence.
  <strong>{{ review.meta.identicalGroups }} groups agree;
  {{ review.meta.divergentGroups }} do not.</strong>
</p>

<p><a href="{{ '/review/variants/index.html' | rel }}">Compare all {{ review.meta.groupCount }} groups &rarr;</a></p>

<h2>All paragraphs</h2>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table class="review-table">
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Every lexia, with its coordinates and review state.</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Lexia</th>
      <th scope="col">Dimension</th>
      <th scope="col">Setting</th>
      <th scope="col">Status</th>
      <th scope="col">Since workshop</th>
      <th scope="col">Group</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for lexia in review.lexias %}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{ ('/review/lexias/' + lexia.id + '/index.html') | rel }}">{{ lexia.id }}</a></td>
      <td>{{ dimLabel(lexia.dimension) }}</td>
      <td>{{ lexia.setting }}</td>
      <td>{{ statusChip(lexia.status) }}</td>
      <td>{{ driftChip(lexia.driftFromV5) }}</td>
      <td>
        {% if lexia.groupId %}
        <a href="{{ ('/review/variants/' + lexia.groupId + '/index.html') | rel }}">{{ lexia.groupId }}</a>
        {% endif %}
      </td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
